WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.869
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.237
We're happy to have you with us,

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:05.905
and now if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:09.975
President Biden hosted the NBA
champion Golden State Warriors

00:00:09.975 --> 00:00:11.310
today at the White House,

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.113
where they gave him
an honorary jersey,

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:17.784
and he gave them the location
of Israel's nukes.

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:21.554
"Oh, wait, hold on.
I'm gonna need those back."

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.156
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.490
The White House said yesterday

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.659
that it does not keep
visitor logs

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.162
for President Biden's personal
residence in Delaware.

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.830
If you want to know who visited,

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:36.669
you'll just have to watch
"Jay Leno's Garage."

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:39.672
[As Leno] Eh, I think these are
classified documents.

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.342
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:43.743
[Normal voice]
Thank you, it was very...

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.077
Oh, yeah.

00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:46.946
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:49.916
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:52.118
Alabama and Mississippi
yesterday observed

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:55.621
a state holiday that honors
Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:58.458
and Confederate general
Robert E. Lee.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:00:59.959
I'm sorry, did I say "and"?

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:02.795
Because I definitely meant "or."

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:05.298
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:07.133
"I like 'em both!"

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.469
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:12.305
In a new episode of a podcast,
former President Trump said

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.107
that he heard Florida governor
Ron DeSantis may challenge him

00:01:15.107 --> 00:01:17.943
for the Republican presidential
nomination, and added, quote,

00:01:17.943 --> 00:01:20.613
"We'll handle that
the way I handle things."

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.448
So get ready, Ron --

00:01:22.448 --> 00:01:24.617
he's gonna cheat on you.

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:26.786
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.955
That's how he do.

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:31.624
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:33.292
When asked in a new interview

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:35.127
about Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell,

00:01:35.127 --> 00:01:37.630
Louisiana Senator John Kennedy

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.799
said that McConnell
is an enigma,

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:45.304
and added that he, quote, "saw
him smile once back in 2017."

00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:47.306
Said McConnell, "I remember it.

00:01:47.306 --> 00:01:49.642
It was at the end
of 'Marley &amp; Me.'"

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:51.977
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.977 --> 00:01:54.314
[As McConnell]
That was very, uh...

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:56.983
That Marley finally got
what was coming to him.

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.317
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.317 --> 00:02:00.486
[ Cackles as McConnell ]

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:02.989
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.457
[Normal voice]
Prince William visited

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:07.793
the charity Together As One
today for a cooking lesson

00:02:07.793 --> 00:02:10.296
and shared his favorite
cake recipe --

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:12.799
"tell someone
to make you a cake."

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:19.305
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:20.372 --> 00:02:23.643
Missouri DMV officials recently
released a list

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:26.813
of the 500 vanity license plates
that were rejected last year,

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:30.650
including one that read "GOTAZZ"

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.152
on the grounds
of false advertising.

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:34.921
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:39.358
The only reason I picked
that joke today --

00:02:39.358 --> 00:02:43.362
the writers also describe what
they want in the key over here,

00:02:43.362 --> 00:02:44.697
and the writer wrote,

00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:48.034
"A man with a flat ass,

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:49.702
shot in profile."

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:53.372
And I was curious if it would be
clear that he'd got no "azz,"

00:02:53.372 --> 00:02:55.208
and, uh...

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.643
totally is.

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:59.145
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:02.247
Today was talk show host
Maury Povich's 84th birthday,

00:03:02.247 --> 00:03:03.649
so pretty safe to say

00:03:03.649 --> 00:03:05.818
he's not the father.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.587
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.489 --> 00:03:12.492
That joke has a flat ass.

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:14.527
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.428 --> 00:03:18.097
And finally, according
to a new report,

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:21.100
three NFL teams are considering
pursuing quarterback Tom Brady

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.435
when he becomes a free agent,

00:03:22.435 --> 00:03:25.271
not to mention about
a dozen bocci leagues.

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:28.074
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

